  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-and-the-big-red-truck-v4-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "76c1a6c5270d001d7122dd50df3754b0c5d2b2e026e9afd3cb90e365a437a0da",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "181b61e57cb369b36fb064dd76cbfe9c39b0604ab75ae66baa34b3b2ea1de1b0",
      "text": "悟空和\n大红消防车",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ab22c8c7dc44df16db304d1d1377a0887e597142e6cfd90f59b9c088e23a14f6",
      "text": "一辆大红车开过来。\n“看那些轮子！”\n悟空的尾巴“嘣”地翘起来！",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "112713cf2fb8a1f5c5bfd87270e081f0bdf7219ab7e621dcce3df70980f792b0",
      "text": "在消防站，本叔叔挥挥手。\n“快来看看吧！”\n悟空有好多问题想问。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "15eae8e0c94bfad2d8363ffe82463408e0c42d0a5fadc580b83b83ef7a35221a",
      "text": "“为什么穿大靴子？”\n“大靴子能保护我的脚。”\n悟空看看自己的鞋：\n“我的只会吱吱响！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4ab0c3bd50d51f3d46885ca013b6d5ab2236a2d2807749384f1ff79d8d0514ec",
      "text": "本叔叔借他一顶玩具头盔。\n头盔滑下来，盖住了眉毛。\n“消防员需要眼睛吗？”\n“非常需要！”本叔叔笑了。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "506a2a5ac66bd0f62a33d8a480ee9a17e1ef6753aa2d8bc472e6b72e1375a238",
      "text": "本叔叔拿出一个特别的面罩。\n“它帮我呼吸\n干净的空气。”\n声音一下子变了样！",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "031156894fd659d37eb7fbda9d86429f333c67c1da8ca5ac27f93a505a955676",
      "text": "“还是我呀！”本叔叔说。\n悟空也挥挥手：\n“咦，本叔叔！\n你的声音变啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "96a51507adf610e3d5b77fb9b74505a1d8424c3943cafeb3e68c631cbb000a14",
      "text": "“那是一根大面条吗？”\n“是水带！”本叔叔说，\n“用来把水送过去。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "38da4e7d58a9c52f08f0bf1ddc26c08929be3562aff85d62b0d8a4dec56998be",
      "text": "本叔叔握住水带。\n哗——水喷了出来。\n一颗小水珠亲了亲\n悟空的鼻子。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c9464b812af992ce7b9bd7d83e1dd02ed8cba4a9a6405fa96742495f663e100d",
      "text": "“那梯子呢？”\n“它帮我们爬到高处。”\n悟空站在下面，\n尾巴往上伸。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "aa9b29f620a1afbf119f794e74b513f913680a90856107a05a94131020cee63e",
      "text": "接着，本叔叔拿出报警器。\n“嘀！嘀！嘀！”\n“这是警报声，在提醒大家。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6452540151c070af805b13cf4af70cb12375b04f45073925dfe11d3f310d8c28",
      "text": "“听到警报，就到外面去。”\n他们练习怎么走出去。\n“到了外面，就待在那里。”\n本叔叔说。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1f4d64191ee9c3d53e60c395f5cbfe40e4183e7c676bdfec695ec1f4c22c34d0",
      "text": "他们约好在一棵树下集合。\n“数数鼻子！”悟空说。\n八戒把自己数了两遍。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0c19d35dc15e8509be5467dbb32f677c26301bfba620fc67637bc79c6782ad9d",
      "text": "悟空谢谢本叔叔：\n“好大的消防车，\n好多重要的事，\n还有一颗热心肠！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b2b6ec417679f36bdbaa15cb363b211390f2f506f65963093c88fecfa0ef9698",
      "text": "回到家，玩具车响起来：\n呜哇……呜哇……\n声音小了，\n又小了……嘘。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d64c9e897a198ae07e62fac88d753089b5a704881f6c826109cc90daf718a512",
      "text": "他给玩具车盖好被子。\n“晚安，小帮手们。”\n房间安静下来了，\n悟空也安静下来了。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ec8d2925b34f65683b4ac3a96f4d0a62c5669ce90c16387e750248f64252ac20",
